ly\":\"system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, sans-serif\",\"size\":13},\"hovermode\":\"x unified\",\"legend\":{\"orientation\":\"h\",\"x\":0,\"y\":1.08},\"margin\":{\"b\":10,\"l\":10,\"r\":10,\"t\":40},\"paper_bgcolor\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0)\",\"plot_bgcolor\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0)\",\"xaxis\":{\"automargin\":true,\"gridcolor\":\"#e4e3df\",\"linecolor\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0)\",\"zeroline\":false},\"yaxis\":{\"automargin\":true,\"gridcolor\":\"#e4e3df\",\"zeroline\":false}}},\"xaxis\":{\"anchor\":\"y\",\"domain\":[0.0,1.0],\"dtick\":2,\"showgrid\":false,\"showticklabels\":true},\"yaxis\":{\"anchor\":\"x\",\"domain\":[0.5700000000000001,1.0],\"showgrid\":false,\"autorange\":\"reversed\"},\"xaxis2\":{\"anchor\":\"y2\",\"domain\":[0.0,1.0],\"dtick\":2,\"showgrid\":false,\"showticklabels\":true},\"yaxis2\":{\"anchor\":\"x2\",\"domain\":[0.0,0.43],\"showgrid\":false,\"autorange\":\"reversed\"},\"annotations\":[{\"font\":{\"size\":16},\"showarrow\":false,\"text\":\"NBA\",\"x\":0.5,\"xanchor\":\"center\",\"xref\":\"paper\",\"y\":1.0,\"yanchor\":\"bottom\",\"yref\":\"paper\"},{\"font\":{\"size\":16},\"showarrow\":false,\"text\":\"WNBA\",\"x\":0.5,\"xanchor\":\"center\",\"xref\":\"paper\",\"y\":0.43,\"yanchor\":\"bottom\",\"yref\":\"paper\"}],\"margin\":{\"l\":10,\"r\":10,\"t\":40,\"b\":10},\"height\":640,\"hovermode\":\"closest\"},                        {\"displaylogo\": false, \"responsive\": true}                    )                };                            </script>        </div>\n```\n\n\n\nSeason = the calendar year the season ends (NBA 2026 = 2025-26).\n\n## Which seasons each analysis uses\n\n| Analysis | Needs | NBA from | WNBA from |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Archetypes, team net rating, championships | box score, shot locations, position | 2003-04 | 2009 |\n| + defensive-type features (rim blocks, steal types) | play-by-play detail | 2006-07 | 2013 |\n| + creation tags (drives, pull-ups) | play-by-play shot descriptions | 2017-18 | 2019 |\n| **Salary value** | everything above except creation tags, plus salary and age | **2009-10** | **2021** |\n| + hustle stats | NBA.com hustle tracking | 2017-18 | not available |\n\n## Who counts\n\nA player-season is **counted** if the player appeared in at least 15% of team games, or averaged 20+ minutes\nover at least 6 games (NBA) or 4 games (WNBA), which covers injury-shortened seasons. Uncounted rows stay in\nthe data but do not shape the archetypes, labels or value rankings. Players who were hurt for the playoffs\nare not counted on their team's playoff roster.\n\n\n| league   |   player-seasons |   not counted |   kept by injury rule |   likely season-ending |   missed playoffs |   % minutes not counted |\n|:---------|-----------------:|--------------:|----------------------:|-----------------------:|------------------:|------------------------:|\n| NBA      |            11500 |          1313 |                    77 |                    439 |               161 |                    0.49 |\n| WNBA     |             2874 |           194 |                     6 |                     99 |                46 |                    0.3  |\n\n\n\n## Sources\n\n| Data | Source | Use |\n|---|---|---|\n| Box scores, play-by-play, schedules | ESPN, via the sportsdataverse data releases | all stats |\n| NBA salaries 2000-2025 | owner-supplied files; 2025-26 from ESPN's salary list; 2026-27 from Basketball-Reference contracts | salary value |\n| WNBA salaries 2021-2026 | Her Hoop Stats WNBA Salary Cap Database; gaps filled from Spotrac | salary value |\n| NBA hustle stats | NBA.com, via the gabriel1200/site_Data mirror | defense checks |\n| WNBA ages (to 2019) | FiveThirtyEight WNBA-stats (CC BY 4.0) | age |\n\n::: {.caveat}\nRaw source files are not redistributed here. The repository contains the code, a fetch script and\naggregated outputs only.\n:::\n\n",
